    <p>We may suspend or terminate accounts that:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Violate these Terms.</li>
        <li>Upload harmful or illegal content.</li>
        <li>Repeatedly infringe intellectual property rights.</li>
        <li>Misuse the service or interfere with its operation.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You may stop using SailScores at any time by ceasing to access the service.</p>
</section>

